  "result": "I fixed the plan check in `src/server/services/search-service.ts:69`. I haven't run the tests.\n\n**Cause:** the check that blocks colon queries had its condition reversed. It threw \"Field-scoped search is not included in this plan\" when the `advanced_search` feature was **on** (`input.q.includes(\":\") && advanced`). So customers whose plan includes field-scoped search were blocked, and customers whose plan doesn't were let through. Queries without a colon never reach that check, which is why plain keyword searches worked for both.\n\n**Fix:** the condition is now `input.q.includes(\":\") && !advanced`, so only plans without the feature are rejected.",
